      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1903-07-11_WidnesExaminer_art0124" n="art0124">
        <p>WARRINGTON V. CHEADLE HULDIE.—Thie matob. VIM Elayed at Arpley on Saturday, and resulted in a draw. Score :--</p>
